Note: questions and answers in the terminal.

ask "What is your name?" and remember the answer as name.
ask "How old are you?" and remember the answer as age.
say "Hi" and then name and then "! Next year you will be" and then age plus 1 and then ".".

ask "What is 7 times 8?" and remember the answer as guess.
if guess is 56, say "Correct!".
otherwise say "Not quite, it is 56.".
